    "detailed_description": "&quot;Duck Dash&quot; is a top-down arena shooter roguelite game. Players take on the role of a little duck and embark on a journey of growth, strategically selecting optimal skill combinations to become a mighty warrior.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795760/extras/7b4bd3877fc4828a811b745236b45395.poster.avif?t=1711630980\" width=400 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795760/extras/7b4bd3877fc4828a811b745236b45395.webm?t=1711630980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795760/extras/7b4bd3877fc4828a811b745236b45395.mp4?t=1711630980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Currently features the two characters, the Shooting Duck and the Fighter Duck.<br></li><li> The Duck undergoes evolution every 5 level-ups.<br></li><li> Choose different attribute enhancements during character leveling, and select a unique golden skill during each evolution.<br></li><li> Choose from dozens of different golden skills. For example: Ghost, Flame Arrow, Blade Rain, Companions, Magic Sword, Bloodthirsty, Cursed Ring...<br></li><li> Collect experience points to level up by defeating more enemies and obtaining experience gems.</li></ul>",
